{"id":"trottel","lemma":"Trottel","pos":"noun","rank":1438,"glosses":["idiot, fool, boob, etc."],"ipa":"/ˈtʁɔtəl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c4/De-Trottel.ogg/De-Trottel.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Trottels","plural":"Trottel"},"examples":[{"text":"Unser Lehrer ist ein echter Trottel.","en":"Our teacher is a real idiot.","words":[{"g":"our"},{"g":"to teach","l":"lehren"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"authentic","l":"echt"},null]},{"text":"Das ist was für Trottel.","en":"That's for suckers.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"what"]]},{"text":"Du bist doch ein Trottel!","en":"You must be a fool.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"but / yes"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ich komme mir wie ein Trottel vor.","en":"I feel like an idiot.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"how"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"in front of, ahead of"}]},{"text":"Ich will nicht wie ein Trottel aussehen.","en":"I don't want to look stupid.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"how"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to look, seem"}]}]}